(Juravinski Hospital and Cancer Centre is one of Ontario’s most comprehensive cancer centres and the only site in) Tj
T* (south-central Ontario treating all types of cancer. It is also home to the Breast Assessment Centre \(BAC\), one of) Tj
T* (the most advanced breast screening and assessment centres of its kind, providing care for more than 14,000) Tj
T* (patients annually. Our world-class research team is conducting ground-breaking studies aimed at better) Tj
T* (understanding and treating various types of cancer. With your generous support, we can continue to make strides) Tj
T* (in cancer research, ultimately enhancing the level of care we provide to our patients.) Tj
